<!-- ── FAQ ────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section id="contact" style="padding:80px 0;background:var(--slate);">
  <div class="container-md">
    <div class="text-center mb-48">
      <h2 style="font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:8px;">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <p class="text-muted">Everything you need to know about applying through Iskolarly.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;">
      <div class="faq-item card card-sm">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          <h4>Who is eligible to apply for a scholarship?</h4>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">Eligibility varies per scholarship program. Generally, applicants must be currently enrolled students in good academic standing. Check each scholarship's specific criteria after logging in.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item card card-sm">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          <h4>What documents are required for application?</h4>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">Typical requirements include: certified true copy of grades, proof of enrollment, proof of household income (if need-based), government-issued ID, and a personal essay. Additional documents may be required per program.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item card card-sm">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          <h4>How long does the application process take?</h4>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">After submission, the review process typically takes 5–10 business days. You will receive a notification through the portal and your registered email once a decision has been made.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item card card-sm">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          <h4>Can I apply for multiple scholarships?</h4>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">Yes, you may apply to multiple programs as long as you meet the individual eligibility criteria. However, note that some scholarships may restrict concurrent grants — always read the program guidelines carefully.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item card card-sm">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          <h4>How do I renew my scholarship?</h4>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">Current scholars can submit renewal requirements through their student dashboard. Log in, go to "Renewal & Compliance," upload updated documents (grades, enrollment certificate), and submit before the term deadline.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

